  "packageHash": "GCfauUXOXBwIIbjF6IuR8Z+AGuvSQags2vulhD6e6wJwpnHZTm+U4fYFnPjfQcPREWFyFmOTRyxd0tZYXFUNKA==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 116652,
  "published": "2026-08-23T13:24:48.203Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.9.0: 首个公开预览版。\n      - 文件格式兼容 SQLite 3（b-tree/记录序列类型/溢出页/回滚日志）\n      - SQL 子集：SELECT(JOIN/GROUP BY/ORDER BY/LIMIT)、INSERT…SELECT、UPDATE、DELETE、DDL\n      - COUNT(*)/MAX/MIN(rowid 别名) 快路径；投影下推；原地 UPDATE\n      - 崩溃恢复（热日志自动回放）、显式事务、参数绑定",
